    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On October 28, 2026, the Reporting Person exercised the incentive stock option granted 10/14/2021 under the Company's 2017 Stock Option Plan (the &quot;2017 Plan&quot;) for the purchase of 5,000 shares of the Company's Common Stock at an exercise price of $7.005 per share (the &quot;Option shares&quot;). As permitted by the 2017 Plan, the Reporting Person elected to pay the exercise price of the Option Shares by having the Company withhold from the Option Shares a number of shares having a fair market value equal to the aggregate exercise price of $35,025. Since the fair market value of the Company's Common Stock on October 28, 2026, (as determined in accordance with the 2017 Plan) was $13.66 per share, the Company withheld 2,564 shares of Common Stock ($35,025 divided by $13.66) to pay the aggregate exercise price of the option.</footnote>
